    {
      "bbox": [
        349,
        713,
        1740,
        1255
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to familiarize myself with the major problems con-\nfronting the heads of our city agencies, as I assume the duties of\nDeputy Mayor, I would appreciate the head of each agency reporting\nto me the two most urgent matters which are currently causing concern\neither for the proper administration and functioning of the department\nor agency, or the Mayor's over-all objectives regarding the welfare\nof our city and its citizens as they relate to the particular agency.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.3576,
          "min": -1.7679
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 97,
          "mean": -0.0022,
          "min": -0.1417
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 197,
        "area_px": 759424,
        "density": 0.00026,
        "chars": 472,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 2395.94
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        349,
        1277,
        1717,
        1800
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In connection therewith, and for proper study and considera-\ntion, I ask the head of each agency for his recommendations as to\nhow these problems might be resolved, and to what degree, with due\nconsideration for their feasibility, and economy of funds and time.\nThese should also consider relief which might be provided through\nlocal, state and federal legislation and grants-in-funds provided\nby the state and federal governments for broad interrelated programs.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3132,
          "min": -1.6725
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 94,
          "mean": -0.0016,
          "min": -0.1435
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 210,
        "area_px": 720825,
        "density": 0.00029,
        "chars": 463,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 2204.76
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        349,
        1825,
        1706,
        2110
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I would appreciate having this information, as briefly and\nconcisely as the problem permits, by noon, Wednesday, March 20, 1961.\nIn no case shall the statement of a problem and the suggested\nsolution exceed one side of one sheet of paper.",
